2.
Definitions
.-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,--
(a)
"Act" means the Repatriation of Prisoners Act, 2003 (
49 of 2003
);
(b)
"application" means an application made under section 4 of the Act;
(c)
"diplomatic channel" means through the missions of the respective countries;
(d)
"section" means a section of the Act;
(e)
all other words and expressions used in these rules and not defined but defined in the Act shall have the meanings
respectively assigned to them in that Act.
